 corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, your good or bad actions give\u00a0<strong>Karma</strong>. For example: Robbing a helpless man in need might end up <i>very</i>\u00a0bad for you down the line -- but help him instead, and you'll find <i>very</i> nice rewards later.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD A TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256410/extras/093072024b1133a00d86ac40d159394d.poster.avif?t=1770948869\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256410/extras/093072024b1133a00d86ac40d159394d.webm?t=1770948869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256410/extras/093072024b1133a00d86ac40d159394d.mp4?t=1770948869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why go alone when you can bring some pals? Recruit helpers, mercenaries, or even monsters to fight with you in combat!</p>","developers":["JustinMakesGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256410/79e5ff9fd630f2b48fbaaecc32479d32d85b440e/header.jpg?t=1770948869","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3256410/354624955/b4ae9338ebeaf4e04f5614686b3b167ed896fb6f/1751570844/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760212740","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3256410/354624955/b4ae9338ebeaf4e04f5614686b3b167ed896fb6f/1751570844/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760212740","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3256410/354624955/b4ae9338ebeaf4e04f56146